{"2172970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lorne", "steam_appid": 2172970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, Craft, Defend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in charge of the defense of a village. Survive wave after wave of attackers and keep improving your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Lorne for hidden artifacts that unlocks new powers and technologies. Improve your bastion and keep your Powercore safe, no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR HOME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lorne, every structure starts with exploration. Gather materials, and bring them back to craft and build your own home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/b1d2e313f1c88602d00f4d05309c31ae.poster.avif?t=1787669708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/b1d2e313f1c88602d00f4d05309c31ae.webm?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/b1d2e313f1c88602d00f4d05309c31ae.mp4?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT POWERFUL ARTIFACTS</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become strong enough to defend your home. Craft items using harvested resources, upgrade your abilities with soul fragments, and explore the land to uncover ancient trinkets that grant untold power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/96e22ee45e10ffaa20b532b1f5876572.poster.avif?t=1787669708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/96e22ee45e10ffaa20b532b1f5876572.webm?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/96e22ee45e10ffaa20b532b1f5876572.mp4?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD A BASTION OF JUSTICE</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your base, tailor the perfect defense. Upgrade, and design your own own fortifications. withstand wave after wave crashing over your ramparts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/a364875929b5a9e98b0465089e28c710.poster.avif?t=1787669708\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/a364875929b5a9e98b0465089e28c710.webm?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/a364875929b5a9e98b0465089e28c710.mp4?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE INVASION</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you start the game, the clock is ticking. The invasion is coming, and each wave is a little stronger than the last. Plantlings, Evil Mages, Stumplings, Elementals, hordes of Undead, the enemy forces are after one thing only, the total destruction of your Powercore, and with it, Lorne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/f1970f1439ac1a3fae8ae2c5667401b0.poster.avif?t=1787669708\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/f1970f1439ac1a3fae8ae2c5667401b0.webm?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/f1970f1439ac1a3fae8ae2c5667401b0.mp4?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DO YOUR DUTY AS A RANGER</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do what you need to do in order to protect Lorne. As a ranger you investigate conflicts, uncover mysteries or find ways to take down dangerous mythical creatures. You guard the borders and roam the lands, all to keep the peace of Lorne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/440877ceafee0cd7fe353b1fbf413c7b.poster.avif?t=1787669708\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/440877ceafee0cd7fe353b1fbf413c7b.webm?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/440877ceafee0cd7fe353b1fbf413c7b.mp4?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build, Craft, Defend.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are in charge of the defense of a village. Survive wave after wave of attackers and keep improving your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world of Lorne for hidden artifacts that unlocks new powers and technologies. Improve your bastion and keep your Powercore safe, no matter the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR HOME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Lorne, every structure starts with exploration. Gather materials, and bring them back to craft and build your own home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/b1d2e313f1c88602d00f4d05309c31ae.poster.avif?t=1787669708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/b1d2e313f1c88602d00f4d05309c31ae.webm?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/b1d2e313f1c88602d00f4d05309c31ae.mp4?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT POWERFUL ARTIFACTS</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become strong enough to defend your home. Craft items using harvested resources, upgrade your abilities with soul fragments, and explore the land to uncover ancient trinkets that grant untold power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/96e22ee45e10ffaa20b532b1f5876572.poster.avif?t=1787669708\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/96e22ee45e10ffaa20b532b1f5876572.webm?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/96e22ee45e10ffaa20b532b1f5876572.mp4?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD A BASTION OF JUSTICE</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your base, tailor the perfect defense. Upgrade, and design your own own fortifications. withstand wave after wave crashing over your ramparts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/a364875929b5a9e98b0465089e28c710.poster.avif?t=1787669708\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2172970/extras/a364875929b5a9e98b0465089e28c710.webm?t=1787669708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.